INSERT INTO public.vector_store (id, content, metadata, embedding) VALUES ('b9990d66-b1da-4c00-bbff-ca66bb5b7960', '问题：用 Java 写一个单例模式

答案：当然可以，Java 实现单例模式有几种常见写法，下面给你几个标准版本。

---

## 1. 饿汉式
类加载时就创建实例，线程安全。

```java
public class Singleton {
    private static final Singleton INSTANCE = new Singleton();

    private Singleton() {
    }

    public static Singleton getInstance() {
        return INSTANCE;
    }
}
```

### 特点
- 线程安全
- 实现简单
- 类加载时就创建对象，可能会浪费内存

---

## 2. 懒汉式
第一次使用时才创建实例。

```java
public class Singleton {
    private static Singleton instance;

    private Singleton() {
    }

    public static synchronized Singleton getInstance() {
        if (instance == null) {
            instance = new Singleton();
        }
        return instance;
    }
}
```

### 特点
- 延迟加载
- 线程安全
- `synchronized` 性能稍差

---

## 3. 双重检查锁（DCL）
推荐，兼顾线程安全和性能。

```java
public class Singleton {
    private static volatile Singleton instance;

    private Singleton() {
    }

    public static Singleton getInstance() {
        if (instance == null) {
            synchronized (Singleton.class) {
                if (instance == null) {
                    instance = new Singleton();
                }
            }
        }
        return instance;
    }
}
```

### 关键点
- `volatile` 必须加，防止指令重排
- 线程安全
- 性能比直接加 `synchronized` 好

---

## 4. 静态内部类
这是开发中非常推荐的一种写法。

```java
public class Singleton {
    private Singleton() {
    }

    private static class Holder {
        private static final Singleton INSTANCE = new Singleton();
    }

    public static Singleton getInstance() {
        return Holder.INSTANCE;
    }
}
```

### 特点
- 线程安全
- 延迟加载
- 实现优雅，推荐使用

---

## 5. 枚举单例
最安全，能防止反射和反序列化破坏单例。

```java
public enum Singleton {
    INSTANCE;

    public void doSomething() {
        System.out.println("执行方法");
    }
}
```

使用：

```java
Singleton.INSTANCE.doSomething();
```

### 特点
- 线程安全
- 防止反序列化破坏单例
- 防止反射攻击
- 《Effective Java》推荐

---

## 推荐
如果是面试回答，建议这样说：

- **一般推荐：静态内部类**
- **最安全推荐：枚举单例**
- **如果面试官问线程安全和懒加载：双重检查锁 DCL**

---

如果你愿意，我还可以继续给你补充：
1. **单例模式的优缺点**
2. **如何防止反射破坏单例**
3. **Spring 中单例 bean 和设计模式单例的区别**', '{"type": "conversation", "model": "linglong", "answer": "当然可以，Java 实现单例模式有几种常见写法，下面给你几个标准版本。\n\n---\n\n## 1. 饿汉式\n类加载时就创建实例，线程安全。\n\n```java\npublic class Singleton {\n    private static final Singleton INSTANCE = new Singleton();\n\n    private Singleton() {\n    }\n\n    public static Singleton getInstance() {\n        return INSTANCE;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 特点\n- 线程安全\n- 实现简单\n- 类加载时就创建对象，可能会浪费内存\n\n---\n\n## 2. 懒汉式\n第一次使用时才创建实例。\n\n```java\npublic class Singleton {\n    private static Singleton instance;\n\n    private Singleton() {\n    }\n\n    public static synchronized Singleton getInstance() {\n        if (instance == null) {\n            instance = new Singleton();\n        }\n        return instance;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 特点\n- 延迟加载\n- 线程安全\n- `synchronized` 性能稍差\n\n---\n\n## 3. 双重检查锁（DCL）\n推荐，兼顾线程安全和性能。\n\n```java\npublic class Singleton {\n    private static volatile Singleton instance;\n\n    private Singleton() {\n    }\n\n    public static Singleton getInstance() {\n        if (instance == null) {\n            synchronized (Singleton.class) {\n                if (instance == null) {\n                    instance = new Singleton();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return instance;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 关键点\n- `volatile` 必须加，防止指令重排\n- 线程安全\n- 性能比直接加 `synchronized` 好\n\n---\n\n## 4. 静态内部类\n这是开发中非常推荐的一种写法。\n\n```java\npublic class Singleton {\n    private Singleton() {\n    }\n\n    private static class Holder {\n        private static final Singleton INSTANCE = new Singleton();\n    }\n\n    public static Singleton getInstance() {\n        return Holder.INSTANCE;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 特点\n- 线程安全\n- 延迟加载\n- 实现优雅，推荐使用\n\n---\n\n## 5. 枚举单例\n最安全，能防止反射和反序列化破坏单例。\n\n```java\npublic enum Singleton {\n    INSTANCE;\n\n    public void doSomething() {\n        System.out.println(\"执行方法\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n使用：\n\n```java\nSingleton.INSTANCE.doSomething();\n```\n\n### 特点\n- 线程安全\n- 防止反序列化破坏单例\n- 防止反射攻击\n- 《Effective Java》推荐\n\n---\n\n## 推荐\n如果是面试回答，建议这样说：\n\n- **一般推荐：静态内部类**\n- **最安全推荐：枚举单例**\n- **如果面试官问线程安全和懒加载：双重检查锁 DCL**\n\n---\n\n如果你愿意，我还可以继续给你补充：\n1. **单例模式的优缺点**\n2. **如何防止反射破坏单例**\n3. **Spring 中单例 bean 和设计模式单例的区别**", "question": "用 Java 写一个单例模式", "createdAt": "1776320358920"}', '[-0.06536848,0.050727125,0.021056194,0.005430428,-0.03042888,-0.0036233661,-0.050098583,-0.053167354,-0.071801804,-0.045624834,0.00323977,0.07324376,0.013689299,-0.039339405,0.0040439353,-0.028524766,-0.013957354,-0.019836081,-0.075536095,-0.01118437,0.01591693,0.02135198,-0.013800219,0.06913974,-0.058528457,-0.08866155,-0.039783083,0.02183263,0.032037213,0.014484221,0.019115105,0.09302438,0.083928995,-0.016795041,0.03527236,-0.016212715,-0.046992842,-0.024217397,0.108922824,-0.013134702,-0.045883648,-0.040855303,0.045883648,-0.044885375,0.065479405,-0.030003691,0.080971144,0.009862581,-0.032388456,0.11801821,0.021204086,0.016406823,0.08866155,0.029134821,0.024032531,0.059157,0.007496301,0.032111157,-0.026750056,0.02549297,0.011313776,0.013864921,0.052353945,-0.018800834,0.034126192,0.0005427539,-0.024716534,-0.035863932,0.021943549,-0.06610794,0.012191888,0.020446138,-0.0061652684,0.004963642,0.018468076,-0.00041565878,-0.0030410395,-0.0028908362,0.00094050384,-0.030909533,0.012561619,-0.028432332,0.0025996729,0.0601183,-0.04991372,-0.020557057,0.03571604,0.009391174,-0.036584906,0.001298681,0.01952181,0.025992107,-0.028358387,0.03941335,0.035050523,0.000726753,-0.09953165,-0.028506279,-0.020353705,0.021093167,0.001433864,0.0070942184,0.01577828,0.0008937097,-0.02538205,-0.023182148,0.045402996,-0.022220848,-0.008771874,-0.09324622,-0.052132104,-0.04203844,0.031075912,0.003819786,-0.008032411,0.031427156,0.0038452048,-0.05468325,0.03244392,-0.021906575,0.0069093527,0.026361838,0.024531668,-0.030724667,0.0009618789,0.027914708,-0.032758188,-0.0032189726,0.016628662,-0.022830904,0.039672162,-0.032832135,0.013754002,0.017765585,0.014511951,-0.0009197065,0.0072975704,0.033627056,-0.02750800